2328..2405 Comment "/// Winding a composite is summing the windings (cubical\'s `winding-hom`), by"
2406..2480 Comment "/// induction on the first loop, written last so its match stands directly"
2481..2559 Comment "/// under the recursion, where the checkers read it as a fold, and summed with"
2560..2624 Comment "/// `wind(q)` first because the sum descends its second summand:"
2625..2705 Comment "/// `Path.here(wind(q))` on the empty word, and the recursive call carried along"
2706..2779 Comment "/// `up` or `down`. The composite in its type is read off the parameters\'"
2780..2832 Comment "/// written types, and the kernel reads its endpoint"
2833..2885 Comment "/// `plus(wind(q), wind(p))` as the call it returns."
